==== hyperbricks yaml {!{head}} ====
head:
  - type: head
  - javascript_10:
      - type: javascript
      - attributes:
          type: text/javascript
      - file: hyperbricks-test-files/assets/main.js
==== explainer ====
Extra attributes like id, data-role, data-action, type
==== expected json ====
{
  "ConfigCategory": "",
  "ConfigType": "<HEAD>",
  "Css": null,
  "Favicon": "",
  "HyperBricksFile": "",
  "HyperBricksKey": "",
  "HyperBricksPath": "",
  "Items": {
    "@order": [
      "javascript_10"
    ],
    "javascript_10": {
      "@type": "<JAVASCRIPT>",
      "attributes": {
        "type": "text/javascript"
      },
      "file": "hyperbricks-test-files/assets/main.js"
    }
  },
  "Js": null,
  "MetaData": null,
  "Title": ""
}

==== expected output ====
<head><script type="text/javascript">
console.log("Hello World!")
</script><meta name="generator" content="hyperbricks runtime"></head>
